# Tests

Maps: `test/README.md`, `test/components/README.md`, `test/mocks/README.md`.

- `vitest.config.ts` serves `#build/ui/<kebab>` from `src/theme` through `resolveTheme` on every run. Tests do not need `pnpm dev:prepare`; `pnpm typecheck` still does.
- `#imports` → `test/mocks/imports.ts`. Do not point it at `src/shims` or the Vue stub.
- Mount `src/runtime/components/<Pascal>.vue` directly. Do not load the Vite `ui()` plugin.
- Each component spec covers default snapshot, variant classes, `ui` slot merge, slots, and `vitest-axe`.
- Build code has its own specs: `test/utils/`, `test/templates.spec.ts`, `test/theme-css.spec.ts`, `test/scripts.spec.ts`.
- Assert semantic classes (`bg-primary`), not palette colors.
- Reset any `appConfig.ui` mutation before the test ends.
